---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Data Retention Policy" description="Data Retention Policy of New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG.">
	
	<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-teal-950/40 via-background to-background pt-20 pb-12 text-center relative border-b border-border/40">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4">Data Retention Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
				Guidelines on how long New Life Integration retains personal data in compliance with GDPR.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="py-16">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground space-y-6">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">1. General Retention Principle</h2>
			<p>
				We retain personal data only for as long as is necessary to satisfy the purpose for which it was collected, such as managing your inquiries, training modules, or branch coordinates.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">2. Retention Periods</h2>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
				<li><strong>General Inquiries:</strong> Retained for 6 months after the last communication.</li>
				<li><strong>Branch Application Data:</strong> Retained for 2 years to facilitate coordination, or deleted immediately upon written request.</li>
				<li><strong>Event Registration Data:</strong> Retained for 12 months following the completion of the event to facilitate feedback loops.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
